window.ALLYSPAN_LOCALE={"language":"zh-Hans","routes":["/","/about/allyspan-and-logo/","/about/our-mission/","/about/our-support/","/about/connect/","/resources/introduction-to-classroom-studio/","/resources/qr-studio/","/showcase/publications/","/showcase/how-to-publish/","/showcase/submit-your-work/","/showcase/submission-privacy/"],"messages":{"Allyspan | Community Support, Learning and Publications":"Allyspan | 社区支持、学习与出版","Skip to content":"跳转到正文","Allyspan":"Allyspan","About Us":"关于我们","Programs":"项目","Resources":"资源","Students Initiative":"学生倡议","Showcase":"成果展示","Support":"支持","Allyspan & Logo":"Allyspan 与标志","Our Mission":"我们的使命","Our Support":"我们的支持","Connect":"联系我们","Introduction to Classroom Studio":"Classroom Studio 简介","A basic guide for teachers and learners":"教师与学习者入门指南","Classroom Studio":"Classroom Studio","Thoughtful presentations for multilingual classrooms":"为多语言课堂精心设计的演示文稿","Allyspan QR Studio":"Allyspan QR Studio","Create and download a free QR code for your link":"免费为链接创建并下载二维码","Apply as Volunteer":"申请成为志愿者","Coming soon":"即将推出","Apply as Intern":"申请实习","How to Publish Your Work":"如何发表作品","Community Awareness Publications":"社区议题出版物","English":"English","More languages coming soon":"更多语言即将推出","Subscribe":"订阅","Website subscriptions are coming soon":"网站订阅功能即将推出","Teachers can already subscribe to Classroom Studio updates in their Studio account settings":"教师现在即可在 Studio 账户设置中订阅 Classroom Studio 更新","Understanding grows.":"增进理解。","Communities move forward.":"让社区向前迈进。","Allyspan brings together community support, accessible learning and thoughtful public discussion. We make room for people’s experiences, questions and possibilities.":"Allyspan 将社区支持、无障碍学习与深入的公共讨论相结合。我们重视每个人的经历、疑问与可能性。","Community Awareness":"社区议题","Publications":"出版物","Featured discussion paper":"精选讨论文章","14 November 2026":"2026年11月14日","Psychedelics in New York City":"纽约市的迷幻药议题","Columbia’s research, unanswered questions, and who the evidence leaves out.":"哥伦比亚大学的研究、尚未解答的问题，以及未被现有证据涵盖的人群。","Our first community awareness publication examines psychedelic research, psychiatric disability, access and commercialisation. It asks what trial findings can tell us - and what remains uncertain for people outside the populations studied.":"我们的首篇社区议题文章探讨迷幻药研究、精神障碍相关残障、获取机会与商业化。文章审视试验结果能告诉我们什么，以及对研究人群之外的人而言，哪些问题仍不确定。","Read the publication":"阅读文章","Learning across languages":"跨越语言的学习","Classroom Studio helps teachers create presentations that welcome multilingual learners.":"Classroom Studio 帮助教师制作欢迎不同语言学习者参与的演示文稿。","Discover Classroom Studio":"了解 Classroom Studio","Support rooted in dignity":"以尊严为本的支持","Our mission centres belonging, anti-oppression and support that respects each person’s choices.":"我们的使命重视归属感、反压迫，以及尊重每个人选择的支持。","Get to know Allyspan":"认识 Allyspan","Share a resource simply":"轻松分享资源","Create a printable QR code for a lesson, workshop or community link. Free to use with no sign-up or scan tracking.":"为课程、工作坊或社区链接创建可打印的二维码。免费使用，无需注册，也不追踪扫描记录。","Try the free QR code generator":"试用免费二维码生成器","Work alongside Allyspan":"与 Allyspan 携手合作","See what is available now, what we are developing and how to start a conversation about partnership.":"了解现有服务、正在开发的项目，以及如何开启合作对话。","Explore programs and partnerships":"探索项目与合作","Support that stays beside you":"始终相伴的支持","Allyspan & Logo | Our Name and Meaning":"Allyspan 与标志 | 名称与寓意","A name built around connection.":"一个以联结为核心的名字。","A symbol of support, growth, and possibility.":"支持、成长与可能性的象征。","Our name":"我们的名字","An ally. A bridge.":"一位同行者。一座桥梁。","A next step together.":"一起迈出下一步。","Finding support can mean facing unfamiliar systems, complicated forms, or uncertainty about where to begin. Allyspan brings together two ideas that guide the organization we are building.":"寻求支持可能意味着面对陌生的制度、复杂的表格，或不知从何开始。Allyspan 结合了两个理念，指引着我们正在建设的组织。","Ally":"Ally（同行者）","means someone who stands beside you - listening, offering support, and respecting your choices.":"指在你身旁倾听、提供支持并尊重你选择的人。","Span":"Span（跨度）","is the reach of a bridge: a connection between two points. For us, it represents the distance between a person and support that can feel out of reach.":"是桥梁连接两点的距离。对我们而言，它代表着一个人与看似难以获得的支持之间的距离。","Together,":"这两个词结合起来，","expresses our commitment to help bridge that distance through practical guidance, connections to appropriate services, and follow-through.":"表达了我们通过实际指导、连接合适服务与持续跟进，帮助缩短这段距离的承诺。","Our tree-and-sun emblem":"我们的树与太阳徽标","Our symbol":"我们的象征","Many paths.":"不同的道路。","Connected sources of strength.":"彼此联结的力量。","The tree represents life, resilience, and growth supported by connection. Its intertwined trunk reflects the relationships between individuals, families, communities, and professionals.":"树象征生命、韧性与在联结中获得支持的成长。交织的树干体现个人、家庭、社区与专业人员之间的关系。","Each branch and leaf suggests a different path, need, or possibility. All belong to one tree - a reminder to see the whole person, beyond a single challenge.":"每一根枝条与每一片叶子都代表不同的道路、需要或可能性。它们同属一棵树，提醒我们看见完整的人，而非仅仅某一个困难。","The sun":"太阳","Hope, clarity, and the possibility of seeing a next step.":"希望、清晰，以及看见下一步的可能。","The stepped foundation":"阶梯形基座","Stability and gradual progress. A small first step can open a way forward.":"稳定与循序渐进。小小的第一步，也能开启前行的道路。","The gold":"金色","Warmth and the value of every person.":"温暖，以及每个人的价值。","Our promise":"我们的承诺","Support That Stays Beside You.":"始终相伴的支持。","Our tagline expresses continuity, respect, and a commitment to work alongside each person. Your choices matter. Support should help you move toward your own goals, at your own pace.":"我们的标语表达持续、尊重与陪伴每个人前行的承诺。你的选择很重要。支持应当帮助你按照自己的步调，朝着自己的目标迈进。","Two versions. One identity.":"两个版本。同一份理念。","Our emblem appears in two forms: a tree and sun without a letter, and a version with an":"我们的徽标有两个版本：不含字母的树与太阳，以及太阳中带有字母","A":"A","inside the sun that connects it directly to the Allyspan name.":"的版本，与 Allyspan 的名称直接呼应。","Both carry the same meaning: connection, dignity, and room to grow. The feeling we want to communicate is simple:":"两者传达同样的寓意：联结、尊严与成长空间。我们想表达的感受很简单：","“I am respected here. Someone will help me find a way forward.”":"“在这里，我受到尊重。有人会帮助我找到前行的方向。”","Our Mission | Allyspan":"我们的使命 | Allyspan","Connecting people with support.":"让人们与支持相连。","Working toward a more equitable community.":"共同建设更加公平的社区。","Why we exist":"我们为何存在","Dignity, access,":"尊严、可及性，","and a way forward.":"以及前行的方向。","Allyspan’s mission is to reduce barriers to community resources, challenge oppression and social exclusion, and support people in pursuing goals they define for themselves.":"Allyspan 的使命是减少获取社区资源的障碍，挑战压迫与社会排斥，并支持人们追求自己定义的目标。","We are building an organization that brings together practical guidance, connections to appropriate agencies, community education, and thoughtful follow-through. Every person deserves to be heard, treated with respect, and included in decisions that affect their life.":"我们正在建设一个将实际指导、合适机构的转介、社区教育与细致跟进相结合的组织。每个人都值得被倾听、被尊重，并参与影响自己生活的决定。","What guides us":"指引我们的理念","Anti-oppression":"反压迫","in everyday practice.":"落实于日常实践。","Anti-oppression means recognizing how racism, poverty, ableism, discrimination, and unequal power can shape someone’s access to support. We aim to challenge these barriers in the way we listen, design programs, and work with others.":"反压迫意味着认识到种族主义、贫困、对残障者的歧视、其他歧视与权力不平等如何影响人们获得支持。我们致力于在倾听、项目设计与合作中挑战这些障碍。","Choice and dignity.":"选择与尊严。","We respect people’s identities, experiences, and right to make their own decisions.":"我们尊重每个人的身份、经历，以及自主作出决定的权利。","Access and inclusion.":"可及与包容。","We seek to make information understandable and participation more accessible across languages, backgrounds, and abilities.":"我们努力让信息易于理解，让不同语言、背景与能力的人更容易参与。","Accountability.":"责任与问责。","We welcome feedback, acknowledge limits, and use what we learn to improve our work.":"我们欢迎反馈、承认局限，并利用所学持续改进工作。","Our beginnings":"我们的起点","Experience that informs":"以经历为基础，","a shared mission.":"形成共同使命。","Allyspan’s direction is informed by its founder’s experiences and a commitment to building more respectful, accessible systems of support.":"Allyspan 的方向源自创始人的经历，以及建设更加尊重人、更加易于获得的支持体系的承诺。","These experiences inform a central concern: how institutions respond to people, and what happens when someone faces barriers to help. Allyspan carries that concern into an organizational commitment to practical support, human dignity, and community connection.":"这些经历带来一个核心关切：机构如何回应人们，以及当人们寻求帮助却遇到障碍时会发生什么。Allyspan 将这一关切转化为对实际支持、人的尊严与社区联结的组织承诺。","As we grow, the perspectives of people using our programs, community partners, staff, and volunteers will help shape our work.":"随着组织成长，项目使用者、社区伙伴、工作人员与志愿者的观点将共同塑造我们的工作。","Our direction":"我们的方向","Support that stays beside you.":"始终相伴的支持。","We are developing our programs step by step, with care for the people they are intended to serve. Our mission is a commitment that guides this work as Allyspan takes shape.":"我们逐步开发项目，始终关心项目将服务的人群。在 Allyspan 不断发展的过程中，我们的使命就是指引工作的承诺。","Programs and Partnerships | Allyspan":"项目与合作 | Allyspan","A place to explore options.":"一起探索不同选择。","A connection to your next step.":"连接你的下一步。","Our approach":"我们的方法","Listen. Connect.":"倾听。联结。","Follow through.":"持续跟进。","Support begins with understanding what matters to you. Our planned Community Navigation program will help people explore available resources, connect with appropriate agencies, and work through obstacles to accessing support.":"支持始于理解你重视的事。我们计划中的社区资源导航项目将帮助人们探索现有资源、联系合适机构，并应对获取支持时遇到的障碍。","Listen:":"倾听：","understand your priorities without assuming what you need.":"理解你优先考虑的事，而不预设你的需要。","Explore:":"探索：","explain relevant options and help you identify questions to ask.":"说明相关选择，并帮助你确定需要提出的问题。","Connect:":"联结：","assist with referrals to organizations suited to your needs.":"协助转介至符合你需要的机构。","Follow through:":"跟进：","check whether a connection was useful and explore next steps together.":"了解联结是否有帮助，并一起探索下一步。","In development":"开发中","Community Navigation":"社区资源导航","We are building a program focused on nonclinical resource navigation, assisted referrals, and follow-up. Areas may include basic needs, benefits, employment resources, housing resources, and community services, depending on program capacity and available partnerships.":"我们正在建设一个以非临床资源导航、协助转介与跟进为重点的项目。服务可能涵盖基本生活需要、福利、就业资源、住房资源与社区服务，具体取决于项目能力和现有合作关系。","This program is in development. Intake and ongoing navigation services are not yet open. We will share eligibility, availability, and how to request support when the program is ready.":"该项目仍在开发中，尚未开放申请或持续导航服务。项目准备就绪后，我们将公布资格条件、可用服务与申请支持的方式。","Available now":"现已可用","Classroom Studio is live and available with sign-in. Allyspan’s presentation tool helps educators prepare and share presentations with translation options so more learners in multilingual classrooms can follow along.":"Classroom Studio 已上线，登录后即可使用。Allyspan 的演示工具帮助教师制作与分享带有翻译选项的文稿，让更多学习者能够跟上多语言课堂。","Looking ahead":"展望未来","Learning and":"学习与","community participation.":"社区参与。","We plan to develop nonformal community workshops, opportunities for student and community contributions, and ways for volunteers and interns to participate. These initiatives will be introduced as their staffing, partnerships, and structure are established.":"我们计划开展非正规社区工作坊，为学生和社区成员提供贡献机会，并建立志愿者与实习生的参与途径。相关人员、合作关系与组织架构到位后，这些计划将陆续推出。","Our approach is grounded in anti-oppression, respect for individual choices, and attention to the barriers people face. We aim to work alongside communities and learn from their experiences.":"我们的方法以反压迫、尊重个人选择及关注人们面对的障碍为基础。我们希望与社区并肩工作，从他们的经历中学习。","Get in touch":"联系我们","Start with a conversation.":"从一次对话开始。","For general questions or partnership inquiries,":"如有一般问题或合作意向，请","connect with Allyspan":"联系 Allyspan",".":"。","For partners and funders":"致合作伙伴与资助者","Build useful support.":"共同建设切实有用的支持。","Start with clear expectations.":"从明确的期望开始。","Our work connects accessible learning, community resources and public discussion. Classroom Studio and QR Studio are available now. Community Navigation and additional workshops are in development; we will publish service availability and eligibility before opening intake.":"我们的工作连接无障碍学习、社区资源与公共讨论。Classroom Studio 和 QR Studio 现已可用。社区资源导航及其他工作坊仍在开发中；开放申请前，我们会公布服务情况与资格条件。","We welcome conversations with educators, community organizations and prospective funders about program priorities, resources, accessibility and how outcomes would be assessed. We distinguish current activity from planned work and will describe the scope and responsibilities of any partnership before it begins.":"我们欢迎教师、社区组织与潜在资助者就项目重点、资源、无障碍及成果评估展开对话。我们明确区分现有活动与计划中的工作，并会在合作开始前说明其范围和各方责任。","Connect | Allyspan":"联系我们 | Allyspan","Every connection begins with a hello.":"每一份联结都从问候开始。","We’re glad you’re here.":"很高兴你来到这里。","Let’s start":"让我们开始","a conversation.":"一次对话。","Have a question, an idea for your community, or a possibility for working together? We welcome thoughtful conversations and the perspectives you bring.":"你有疑问、服务社区的想法，或合作的可能吗？我们欢迎用心的交流，也珍视你带来的观点。","For general questions, partnerships and community connections:":"一般咨询、合作与社区联络：","hello@allyspan.org":"hello@allyspan.org","A little support":"为你的下一堂课","for your next lesson.":"提供一点支持。","Whether you’re creating your first presentation, exploring multilingual learning, or sharing feedback, we’d love to hear how Classroom Studio can work better for you.":"无论你是在制作第一份演示文稿、探索多语言学习，还是分享反馈，我们都希望了解 Classroom Studio 如何更好地帮助你。","For Studio questions, technical issues and suggestions:":"Studio 使用问题、技术故障与建议：","allyspanstudio@allyspan.org":"allyspanstudio@allyspan.org","If something isn’t working, include a short description and the device or browser you’re using. Please leave out student names, passwords and other private information.":"如果遇到故障，请简要说明问题及所用设备或浏览器。请勿提供学生姓名、密码或其他私人信息。","Classroom Studio Guide for Teachers and Learners | Allyspan":"Classroom Studio 教师与学习者指南 | Allyspan","One lesson. More ways to participate.":"一堂课，更多参与方式。","A basic guide for multilingual classrooms.":"多语言课堂入门指南。","Meet the Studio":"认识 Studio","Create once.":"一次创作。","Connect across languages.":"跨越语言建立联结。","Classroom Studio is Allyspan’s online presentation workspace for educators. Create visual lessons, add multilingual text, and share a lesson through a QR code or link so students can follow along in an available language they understand.":"Classroom Studio 是 Allyspan 为教育工作者提供的在线演示工作区。制作可视化课程、添加多语言文字，并通过二维码或链接分享，让学生选择自己理解的可用语言跟随课程。","Teachers sign in with Google to create and save presentations. Students can open shared lessons without an account, choose a lesson language, and move through the slides at their own pace.":"教师使用 Google 登录，制作并保存演示文稿。学生无需账户即可打开共享课程，选择课程语言，并按照自己的进度浏览幻灯片。","For teachers":"教师指南","Create your":"制作你的","first lesson.":"第一堂课。","Sign in.":"登录。","Open Classroom Studio and sign in with Google. Find saved lessons under My presentations.":"打开 Classroom Studio 并使用 Google 登录。已保存的课程位于 My presentations（我的演示文稿）中。","Choose a starting point.":"选择起点。","Browse templates or create a blank presentation. Give your lesson a name you will recognize later.":"浏览模板或创建空白演示文稿。为课程取一个日后容易识别的名称。","Build your slides.":"制作幻灯片。","Edit the English text, add images, and move objects into place. Keep each slide focused and leave room for translations.":"编辑英文内容、添加图片并调整对象位置。每张幻灯片围绕一个重点，并为翻译预留空间。","Choose languages.":"选择语言。","Open Languages in the editor and select those your class needs. Translate your text and review the wording for accuracy and classroom meaning.":"在编辑器中打开 Languages（语言），选择课堂需要的语言。翻译文字，并检查准确性及课堂语境中的含义。","Save and preview.":"保存并预览。","Confirm the save status says Saved before closing. Select Present to check the lesson before class.":"关闭前确认状态显示 Saved（已保存）。上课前选择 Present（演示）检查课程。","Share and present":"分享与演示","Invite your":"邀请你的","students in.":"学生参与。","Keep":"保持","Include QR slide 0":"Include QR slide 0（包含二维码第 0 页）","enabled for a welcome screen. Selecting":"启用，以显示欢迎页。选择","Present":"Present（演示）","turns sharing on and displays the lesson QR code and link. You can also open":"会开启分享并显示课程二维码与链接。你也可以在编辑器中打开","Share & QR":"Share & QR（分享与二维码）","in the editor.":"。","Use":"使用","QR options":"QR options（二维码选项）","to copy the complete lesson link, choose a QR color, or download the QR image. Test the QR code on a second device before class.":"复制完整课程链接、选择二维码颜色或下载二维码图片。上课前，请用另一台设备测试二维码。","The same link continues to work as you update a lesson. Anyone with the link can view it while sharing is on. Use":"更新课程后，同一链接仍可使用。分享开启期间，任何获得链接的人都能查看。需要停止访问时，请在分享窗口使用","Turn sharing off":"Turn sharing off（关闭分享）","in the sharing window when you want to stop access.":"。","For learners":"学习者指南","Scan. Choose.":"扫描。选择。","Follow along.":"跟随课程。","Scan the teacher’s QR code or open the complete shared lesson link. No student sign-in is needed.":"扫描教师的二维码或打开完整课程链接。学生无需登录。","Choose an available":"选择可用的","Lesson language":"Lesson language（课程语言）",", then use":"，然后使用","Next":"Next（下一页）","and":"和","Back":"Back（上一页）","to explore the slides. When available, show English alongside the translation. An internet connection is needed to open a shared lesson.":"浏览幻灯片。如有此选项，可同时显示英文与翻译。打开共享课程需要网络连接。","Before class":"课前准备","A few useful habits.":"几个实用习惯。","Check translations.":"检查翻译。","Review important wording before teaching, particularly instructions and unfamiliar terms.":"上课前检查重要措辞，尤其是说明与不熟悉的术语。","Keep sharing intentional.":"谨慎分享。","Share only material appropriate for everyone who may receive the link. Presenter notes stay in the editor and are not included in the shared student lesson.":"只分享适合所有可能收到链接的人查看的内容。演讲者备注保留在编辑器中，不会包含在学生的共享课程内。","Prepare an offline copy.":"准备离线副本。","Download the presentation with its saved translations and included media. Extract the ZIP, then open":"下载包含已保存翻译与媒体的演示文稿。解压 ZIP 后，在现代浏览器中打开","index.html":"index.html","in a modern browser. A Home Screen shortcut still needs internet.":"。主屏幕快捷方式仍需网络连接。","Test your display.":"测试显示效果。","Use Full screen for the teacher screen. Phone browser controls and fullscreen behavior vary by device.":"教师端可使用 Full screen（全屏）。手机浏览器的控件与全屏表现因设备而异。","Help and feedback":"帮助与反馈","A platform":"一个由我们共同","we are improving together.":"改进的平台。","Classroom Studio continues to develop, so features and controls may change. To report an issue, sign in, return to the home workspace, and select":"Classroom Studio 持续发展，功能与控件可能变化。如需报告问题，请登录，返回主工作区，并在侧栏选择","Report a problem":"Report a problem（报告问题）","in the sidebar.":"。","Explain what you were trying to do, what happened, and which device and browser you used. Include any error message, but leave out student names and private information.":"请说明你原本想做什么、发生了什么，以及使用的设备和浏览器。可附上错误提示，但请勿提供学生姓名或私人信息。","Ready to begin?":"准备好开始了吗？","Your next lesson starts here.":"你的下一堂课从这里开始。","Open Classroom Studio":"打开 Classroom Studio","Free QR Code Generator | Allyspan":"免费二维码生成器 | Allyspan","A little link, made shareable":"小小链接，轻松分享","QR":"二维码","code":"","A free QR code generator for teachers and everyday sharing. No sign-up. No tracking.":"供教师与日常分享使用的免费二维码生成器。无需注册，不追踪使用情况。","Add your link":"添加链接","Website URL":"网站网址","Paste or type a link":"粘贴或输入链接","Your QR code opens this exact page when someone scans it.":"扫描二维码时会打开此处填写的具体页面。","Generate":"生成","Your link stays in your browser. It isn’t saved or sent to Allyspan.":"链接仅保留在你的浏览器中，不会保存或发送给 Allyspan。","Your QR code":"你的二维码","Allyspan edition":"Allyspan 版","Your code will appear here":"添加链接后","after you add a link":"二维码将在这里显示","Download":"下载","A free QR code generator with no sign-up":"无需注册的免费二维码生成器","Create a static QR code for a website link, then download it as a 1184 × 1294-pixel PNG image. Use it on classroom slides, workshop handouts, event posters or everyday resources. The tool works in your browser without an account or a payment step.":"为网站链接创建静态二维码，并下载为 1184 × 1294 像素的 PNG 图片。可用于课堂幻灯片、工作坊资料、活动海报或日常资源。工具在浏览器中运行，无需账户或付费。","How it works":"使用方法","Paste a complete website address. Check that it is the page you want people to open.":"粘贴完整网址，确认它指向你希望大家打开的页面。","Generate your code":"生成二维码","Select Generate to create the QR code locally in your browser. Your link is not sent to Allyspan.":"选择“生成”，在浏览器本地创建二维码。链接不会发送给 Allyspan。","Download and test":"下载并测试","Download the PNG, add it to your material and scan a test copy before sharing or printing.":"下载 PNG，放入所需材料中，并在分享或打印前扫描测试副本。","A QR code generator with no tracking":"不追踪扫描的二维码生成器","Your code contains the destination link itself. It does not pass through an Allyspan redirect, scan counter or subscription service. Entered links and generated images are not uploaded to or saved by Allyspan. This tool page has no analytics or advertising trackers.":"二维码直接包含目标链接，不经过 Allyspan 的跳转、扫描计数器或订阅服务。输入的链接与生成的图片不会上传至 Allyspan，也不会由 Allyspan 保存。此工具页面没有分析或广告追踪器。","Your browser holds the link while the page is open; a downloaded image stays wherever you save it. Visiting this page still involves ordinary web-hosting requests. A website opened after scanning may use its own analytics or tracking.":"页面打开期间，链接保留在浏览器中；下载的图片保存在你选择的位置。访问本页仍涉及常规网站托管请求。扫描后打开的网站可能使用自己的分析或追踪工具。","QR codes for teachers and community workshops":"供教师与社区工作坊使用的二维码","Help learners open a shared lesson, an accessible resource or a feedback page without typing a long address. Pair the QR code with a short written link and a clear description so people can choose how to access the information. Always test access permissions from a student’s device.":"帮助学习者打开共享课程、无障碍资源或反馈页面，无需输入长网址。请在二维码旁附上简短的文字链接与清晰说明，让人们选择访问方式。务必使用学生端设备测试访问权限。","For multilingual slide presentations with student sharing, explore":"如需与学生分享多语言演示文稿，请了解",". For a single link to print or share, this QR tool is ready to use without sign-in.":"。若只需打印或分享单个链接，本二维码工具无需登录即可使用。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题","Is it free?":"免费吗？","Yes. Generating and downloading your QR code is free. There is no paid plan required to keep a generated code working.":"是的。生成与下载二维码均免费。已生成的二维码无需付费计划即可继续使用。","Do I need an account?":"需要账户吗？","No. Allyspan QR Studio does not require an account, email address or sign-up.":"不需要。Allyspan QR Studio 无需账户、电子邮箱或注册。","Is my link stored?":"我的链接会被保存吗？","Not by Allyspan. Your link is processed in the browser and is not uploaded to our servers. A downloaded QR image contains the link you entered, so share that image only with the audience you intend.":"Allyspan 不会保存。链接在浏览器中处理，不上传到我们的服务器。下载的二维码图片包含该链接，因此请仅与预期受众分享。","Does the code expire?":"二维码会过期吗？","The static QR code has no built-in expiry or Allyspan subscription dependency. It keeps pointing to the encoded address. That destination still needs to remain available, and a time-limited destination link can expire.":"静态二维码没有内置到期时间，也不依赖 Allyspan 订阅，始终指向编码的地址。但目标页面仍需保持可访问；有时效的目标链接可能过期。","Can I print it?":"可以打印吗？","Yes. Use the downloaded PNG, keep the white space around the code, and avoid stretching or cropping it. Print a test at the intended size and scan it with a phone before producing more copies. Include a written link as an alternative.":"可以。请使用下载的 PNG，保留二维码周围的留白，避免拉伸或裁切。按预期尺寸打印一份，并用手机扫描测试后再批量制作。请附上文字链接作为替代方式。","The Allyspan Journal | Community Awareness Publications":"The Allyspan Journal | 社区议题出版物","The Allyspan Journal":"The Allyspan Journal","Lived experience held to the evidence":"以证据审视亲身经历","The Allyspan Journal publishes research and policy alongside lived experience and perspectives from people of all backgrounds.":"The Allyspan Journal 发表研究与政策文章，也呈现来自不同背景人群的亲身经历与观点。","Community awareness":"社区议题","Read the article":"阅读文章","Submission Privacy | The Allyspan Journal":"投稿隐私 | The Allyspan Journal","Submission privacy":"投稿隐私","Your work is not published automatically":"你的作品不会自动发表","A submission is for confidential editorial assessment. Publication requires a separate agreement and your approval of the final proof.":"投稿用于保密的编辑评估。发表需要另行达成协议，并获得你对最终校样的批准。","What happens when you send":"发送后会发生什么","The live form sends your manuscript, selected attachments, author details and declarations over HTTPS through Cloudflare to Resend for delivery to the Journal's private editorial inbox. The address journal@allyspan.org forwards to the owner's verified Gmail inbox. Authorized editorial personnel and necessary service providers may process submissions for editorial assessment.":"在线表单通过 HTTPS，经 Cloudflare 与 Resend，将稿件、所选附件、作者信息及声明发送至期刊的私人编辑邮箱。journal@allyspan.org 会转发至所有者已验证的 Gmail 邮箱。获授权的编辑人员及必要的服务提供商可为编辑评估处理投稿。","The submission service does not create public manuscript links or save files in GitHub, a public bucket or a submission database. Files pass through the service into email. A separate receipt is requested for the corresponding author.":"投稿服务不会创建公开稿件链接，也不会将文件保存到 GitHub、公共存储桶或投稿数据库。文件经服务转入电子邮件。服务会另外请求向通讯作者发送收件回执。","Unfinished entries and technical information":"未完成的填写与技术信息","Unfinished entries remain in the open page; the form does not save them in browser storage. When sending is enabled, Cloudflare Turnstile checks requests and the service applies a short-term rate limit using the request IP.":"未完成的内容仅保留在当前打开的页面，表单不会将其保存到浏览器存储中。启用发送后，Cloudflare Turnstile 会检查请求，服务会利用请求 IP 实施短期频率限制。","The submission code does not log form contents or include them in analytics. Website and email providers may process ordinary connection, usage and delivery information according to their service settings.":"投稿代码不会记录表单内容，也不会将其纳入分析。网站与邮件服务提供商可依据服务设置，处理常规连接、使用与投递信息。","Retention, withdrawal and deletion":"保留、撤稿与删除","Submission emails, attachments and editorial correspondence remain in the private editorial mailbox until deleted. This version has no automatic expiry process. Contact journal@allyspan.org with your submission reference to request withdrawal or deletion. Service providers may retain technical records according to their settings.":"投稿邮件、附件与编辑往来会保留在私人编辑邮箱，直至删除。此版本没有自动到期清除机制。如需撤回或删除，请联系 journal@allyspan.org，并注明投稿编号。服务提供商可按其设置保留技术记录。","Do not include confidential participant records, signed consent forms, home addresses, student IDs or unnecessary personal information. Explain pseudonym or safety requests before publication.":"请勿提供参与者保密记录、签署的同意书、家庭住址、学生证件号码或不必要的个人信息。发表前，请说明使用化名或其他安全方面的请求。","Return to the submission page":"返回投稿页","Submit Your Work | The Allyspan Journal":"提交作品 | The Allyspan Journal","Read the Journal":"阅读期刊","Private submissions for editorial review":"用于编辑审阅的私人投稿","Complete the form and review your details before sending. Nothing is published automatically. Sending becomes available after the security check.":"填写表单并在发送前检查信息。任何内容都不会自动发表。完成安全验证后即可发送。","What happens after you submit":"投稿后的流程","An editor reads your complete submission. We aim to give an initial response within 15 business days.":"编辑会阅读完整投稿。我们争取在 15 个工作日内作出初步回复。","If it is a fit, we work with you on revisions.":"如果稿件适合本刊，我们会与你共同修改。","Research articles receive independent methodological review by two independent reviewers. Reviewers are confidential to authors; publication waits if suitable reviewers are unavailable.":"研究文章由两位独立审稿人进行独立的方法学审查。审稿人身份对作者保密；没有合适审稿人时，将暂缓发表。","We publish with the article type and actual review status stated, after your final proof approval.":"经你批准最终校样后，我们会在发表时标明文章类型与实际审阅状态。","Explore the editorial review process":"了解编辑审阅流程","Submit Your Work":"提交作品","Prepare your submission":"准备投稿","Required fields are marked *.":"必填项以 * 标示。","1. Your work":"1. 你的作品","2. About the authors":"2. 作者信息","3. Review and declarations":"3. 检查与声明","Your submission stays private.":"你的投稿保持私密。","Nothing is published automatically. Editorial review, final article design and author proof approval come before publication.":"任何内容都不会自动发表。发表前须完成编辑审阅、文章排版，以及作者对校样的批准。","Submit initially in English. If English isn't your first language, tell us when you submit - we'll discuss translation, and we publish in your language too where we can.":"请先以英文投稿。如果英语不是你的第一语言，请投稿时告知我们。我们会讨论翻译事宜，并在能力允许时也以你的语言发表。","Your work":"你的作品","Article title":"文章标题","*":"*","Article type *":"文章类型 *","Choose one":"请选择","Research Article":"研究文章","Literature or Evidence Review":"文献或证据综述","Policy Review or Policy Analysis":"政策综述或分析","Practice and Community Analysis":"实践与社区分析","Student Perspectives / Community Voices":"学生视角／社区声音","Book or Resource Review":"书籍或资源评论","Commentary":"评论文章","Letter responding to published work":"针对已发表作品的来信","Main topic *":"主要议题 *","Community life":"社区生活","Systems and services":"制度与服务","Justice and rights":"公正与权利","Manuscript word count":"稿件词数","Choose an article type to see its word range.":"选择文章类型，查看词数范围。","Plain-language summary":"通俗摘要","100-150 words.":"100-150 个英文单词。","0 words":"0 个单词","Keywords":"关键词","4-6 different keywords or phrases, separated by commas.":"4-6 个不同关键词或短语，以英文逗号分隔。","Editable manuscript":"可编辑稿件","DOCX, DOC, Pages, TXT, RTF or ODT. A PDF may accompany your editable manuscript. Total attachments: up to 10 MB.":"DOCX、DOC、Pages、TXT、RTF 或 ODT。可另外附上 PDF。附件总大小不超过 10 MB。","Companion PDF (optional)":"补充 PDF（选填）","A PDF does not replace the editable manuscript.":"PDF 不能替代可编辑稿件。","Supporting images (optional)":"辅助图片（选填）","PNG or JPG. Add a caption, alt text and source or permission details for each image.":"PNG 或 JPG。每张图片均须提供图注、替代文字，以及来源或授权信息。","Manuscript language *":"稿件语言 *","Other":"其他","Language and translation notes (optional)":"语言与翻译说明（选填）","Continue to authors":"继续填写作者信息","About the authors":"作者信息","No university affiliation is required. People of all backgrounds may contribute.":"无需大学背景。不同背景的人都可以投稿。","Your publication name":"发表时使用的姓名","Corresponding author email":"通讯作者电子邮箱","Private - used for editorial correspondence, not displayed with the article.":"私密信息，仅用于编辑联系，不会随文章公开。","Role or affiliation (optional)":"身份或所属机构（选填）","ORCID (optional)":"ORCID（选填）","If you have one, enter your ORCID iD or profile URL.":"如有 ORCID，请填写 ORCID iD 或个人资料链接。","Short biography":"简短个人简介","50-80 words.":"50-80 个英文单词。","Your contribution":"你的贡献","Describe your role in creating this work.":"说明你在创作本作品中承担的工作。","Add a coauthor":"添加共同作者","Pseudonym or safety request (optional)":"化名或安全请求（选填）","Editors must privately verify the author and agree on accountability and safety arrangements. Do not include home addresses, student IDs or unnecessary personal data.":"编辑须私下核实作者身份，并商定责任与安全安排。请勿提供家庭住址、学生证件号码或不必要的个人信息。","Continue to review":"继续检查","Review and declarations":"检查与声明","Edit your work":"编辑作品信息","Edit author details":"编辑作者信息","Funding and conflicts of interest":"资助与利益冲突","State any funding and relevant interests, or write None.":"说明任何资助与相关利益；如无，请填写 None。","AI use and prior dissemination":"人工智能使用与此前传播","Describe any AI assistance, prior versions or related work, or write None.":"说明人工智能辅助、先前版本或相关作品；如无，请填写 None。","Does this work involve research with human participants? *":"本作品是否涉及人类参与者研究？ *","No":"否","Yes":"是","Ethics and consent details (optional)":"伦理与知情同意详情（选填）","State the reviewing body, determination, reference if available, and consent approach. Do not upload confidential consent forms or identifying participant records.":"说明审查机构、决定、可用的编号及知情同意方式。请勿上传保密同意书或可识别参与者身份的记录。","Visual permissions":"视觉材料授权","If visuals are included, confirm ownership, source and permission to publish. Otherwise write Not applicable.":"如有视觉材料，请确认所有权、来源及发表授权；否则填写 Not applicable。","Author declarations *":"作者声明 *","All authors approve this submission and the information is accurate.":"所有作者均同意本次投稿，信息准确无误。","Required permissions, ethics information and disclosures are complete.":"所需授权、伦理信息与披露均已完整提供。","I have read the contributor guide and the submission privacy notice.":"我已阅读投稿指南与投稿隐私说明。","I understand this sends work for review and does not publish it. Publication rights are agreed separately after acceptance.":"我理解此操作将作品提交审阅，不会直接发表。录用后另行商定发表权利。","Leave this field empty":"请留空此栏","Your manuscript will be sent privately to the Journal. A receipt will be requested for your email address.":"稿件将私下发送给期刊。服务会请求向你的邮箱发送收件回执。","Preview submission":"预览投稿","Send for editorial review":"发送以供编辑审阅","For Journal questions: journal@allyspan.org. Sending becomes available after the security check.":"期刊咨询：journal@allyspan.org。通过安全验证后可发送。","Your submission preview":"投稿预览","Not submitted. Nothing has been sent or saved.":"尚未提交。没有发送或保存任何内容。","Return to form":"返回表单","How to Publish Your Work | The Allyspan Journal":"如何发表作品 | The Allyspan Journal","Explore the article:":"阅读文章：","Explore the guide":"浏览指南","Welcome & scope":"欢迎与范围","Choose your format":"选择文章形式","Writing & visuals":"写作与视觉材料","Ethics & responsibility":"伦理与责任","Editorial review":"编辑审阅","Rights & corrections":"权利与更正","Community discussion":"社区讨论","Checklist & resources":"核对清单与资源","Contributor guide":"投稿指南","Welcome to The Allyspan Journal":"欢迎来到 The Allyspan Journal","Purpose, scope and editorial identity":"宗旨、范围与编辑定位","Students, researchers, practitioners and community contributors are welcome. You do not need a university affiliation to contribute.":"欢迎学生、研究人员、实务工作者与社区投稿者。无需大学背景即可参与。","Research, policy, student perspectives and community voices":"研究、政策、学生视角与社区声音","A publication of Allyspan connecting academic inquiry with the realities of people navigating care, public services and legal systems. We welcome thoughtful work that improves understanding, examines inequity and offers practical, evidence-informed possibilities.":"Allyspan 的出版物连接学术探究与人们寻求照护、使用公共服务及应对法律体系时的现实经历。我们欢迎增进理解、探讨不平等，并提出以证据为依据的实际可能性的作品。","Who may contribute":"谁可以投稿","Students, researchers, practitioners, advocates and community contributors may submit. An advanced degree, university affiliation or personal connection to Allyspan is not required. Publication depends on quality, relevance, ethics and editorial capacity. Lived experience is valuable knowledge; broad factual or causal claims still need appropriate evidence.":"学生、研究人员、实务工作者、倡导者与社区成员均可投稿。不要求高等学位、大学背景或与 Allyspan 的私人关系。是否发表取决于质量、相关性、伦理与编辑能力。亲身经历是宝贵的知识；广泛的事实或因果主张仍须有适当证据。","Submit initially in English. If English isn't your first language, tell us when you submit - we'll discuss translation, and we publish in your language too where we can. Review takes place in English; publication in another language depends on translation and review capacity.":"请先以英文投稿。如果英语不是你的第一语言，请告知我们；我们会讨论翻译，并在能力允许时也以你的语言发表。审阅以英文进行；其他语言的发表取决于翻译与审阅能力。","What belongs here":"适合的议题","Belonging, mutual aid, organizing and collective well-being; human behavior, relationships and person-in-environment perspectives; development across the life course.":"归属、互助、组织行动与集体福祉；人类行为、人际关系及“人在环境中”的视角；全生命周期发展。","Social welfare systems, public benefits, poverty, housing, employment and education; foundations of social work practice, ethics and engagement with individuals, families, groups and communities.":"社会福利制度、公共福利、贫困、住房、就业与教育；社会工作实践基础、伦理，以及与个人、家庭、群体和社区的互动。","Race, racism, inequality, discrimination and structural injustice; Indigenous communities, sovereignty and self-determination; human rights, environmental justice and equitable access; mental health, voluntary community care, decriminalization and alternatives to incarceration; LGBTQ+ inclusion, disability, aging, HIV/AIDS-related inequities, substance-use policy, recovery, veterans and access to justice.":"种族、种族主义、不平等、歧视与结构性不公；原住民社区、主权与自决；人权、环境正义与公平可及；心理健康、自愿社区照护、去刑事化与监禁替代方案；LGBTQ+ 包容、残障、老龄化、HIV/AIDS 相关不平等、物质使用政策、康复、退伍军人与司法可及性。","Interdisciplinary and international perspectives are welcome when their relevance is explained. Work should connect clearly to Allyspan’s mission.":"欢迎跨学科与国际视角，但须说明相关性。作品应与 Allyspan 的使命有清晰联系。","Our editorial position":"我们的编辑立场","We value dignity, self-determination, accessibility, anti-discrimination and honest inquiry. Critical analysis and respectful disagreement are welcome, including criticism of Allyspan. We distinguish evidence, interpretation and personal experience. Academic rigor should make an argument clearer, not harder to understand.":"我们重视尊严、自决、无障碍、反歧视与诚实探究。欢迎批判分析与尊重的分歧，包括对 Allyspan 的批评。我们区分证据、解释与个人经历。学术严谨应使论证更清楚，而非更难理解。","An editor reads your piece and checks that the submission is complete. We aim to respond within 15 business days and will communicate significant delays.":"编辑会阅读稿件并检查完整性。我们争取在 15 个工作日内回复，并会告知重大延误。","Research articles require independent methodological review. Formal peer review requires at least two independent qualified reviewers whose identities are confidential to authors. We hold research submissions when qualified review is unavailable.":"研究文章需要独立的方法学审查。正式同行评审须由至少两位独立、合格且身份对作者保密的审稿人进行。无法安排合格评审时，研究投稿将暂缓处理。","We publish after final author approval, with the article type and actual review status stated.":"经作者最终批准后发表，并标明文章类型与实际审阅状态。","This guide sets the contributor and editorial standards for The Allyspan Journal. Choose a section to explore the requirements before preparing your work.":"本指南规定 The Allyspan Journal 的投稿与编辑标准。准备作品前，请选择相应章节了解要求。","Next: Choose your format":"下一节：选择文章形式","What we publish":"我们发表什么","Formats and manuscript lengths":"文章形式与稿件长度","Word counts exclude references, tables and figure captions. Abstracts count separately. Editors may approve exceptions when justified; length alone never demonstrates rigor.":"词数不包括参考文献、表格与图注。学术摘要另计。有充分理由时，编辑可批准例外；篇幅长短本身不代表严谨程度。","Research Article | 2,500-5,000 words":"研究文章 | 2,500-5,000 个英文单词","Original quantitative, qualitative or mixed-methods work. Include a 150-250-word abstract; introduction and question; methods; results; discussion; limitations; ethics statement; funding/conflict disclosures; and references. Report sampling, measures or interview approach, analysis, relevant uncertainty and the basis for conclusions. Human-participant work requires the documentation described in Ethics & responsibility. Methodological expertise must be available before acceptance.":"原创定量、定性或混合方法研究。须包含 150-250 词摘要、引言与研究问题、方法、结果、讨论、局限、伦理声明、资助与利益冲突披露，以及参考文献。说明抽样、测量或访谈方法、分析、相关不确定性及结论依据。人类参与者研究须提供“伦理与责任”所述文件。录用前须能安排相应方法学专家。","Literature or Evidence Review | 2,000-4,000 words":"文献或证据综述 | 2,000-4,000 个英文单词","Synthesize what is known, disagreements and gaps. Include a 150-200-word abstract, search sources and dates, selection approach, synthesis and limitations. A narrative review must be labeled as such. Use “systematic review” or “meta-analysis” only when the actual methods support that designation; provide search strategies and applicable reporting checklist.":"综合现有知识、分歧与空白。包含 150-200 词摘要、检索来源与日期、筛选方法、综合分析及局限。叙述性综述须明确标示。仅在实际方法符合时使用“系统综述”或“荟萃分析”，并提供检索策略及适用的报告清单。","Policy Review or Policy Analysis | 1,500-3,000 words":"政策综述或分析 | 1,500-3,000 个英文单词","Identify the jurisdiction, policy instrument, status and as-of date. Explain the problem, affected groups, policy mechanism, evidence, implementation, costs or resource implications, equity effects, alternatives and recommendations. Link to primary legislation, regulations or agency material. Distinguish proposed rules from enacted law and enacted law from implementation.":"说明司法管辖区、政策工具、状态及信息截止日期。解释问题、受影响群体、政策机制、证据、实施、成本或资源影响、公平性、替代方案与建议。链接原始法律、法规或机构文件，区分拟议规则、已通过法律及实际执行。","Practice and Community Analysis | 1,200-2,500 words":"实践与社区分析 | 1,200-2,500 个英文单词","An evidence-informed discussion of service design, access barriers, community initiatives or professional practice. Include context, evidence, practical implications and limitations. Program descriptions must not claim effectiveness without suitable evaluation.":"以证据为依据，讨论服务设计、获取障碍、社区计划或专业实践。包含背景、证据、实际意义与局限。未经适当评估，不得宣称项目有效。","Student Perspectives / Community Voices | 800-1,500 words":"学生视角／社区声音 | 800-1,500 个英文单词","Analytical essays and reflective journals combining experience, reflection and relevant scholarship. Explain the perspective, connect it to broader systems, and identify implications. First-person writing is welcome. Label reflective work clearly; it is not original empirical research. No minimum reference count is imposed, but factual claims require sources.":"结合经历、反思与相关学术文献的分析性短文或反思札记。说明视角，与更广泛制度相联系，并指出意义。欢迎第一人称写作。反思性作品须明确标示，并非原创实证研究。不设参考文献最低数量，但事实主张须有来源。","Book or Resource Review | 700-1,200 words; Commentary | 600-1,000 words":"书籍或资源评论 | 700-1,200 词；评论文章 | 600-1,000 词","Reviews identify the work, assess its evidence, contribution, limitations and audience, and disclose relationships to its creators. Commentaries make a focused, supported argument and acknowledge counterarguments. Letters responding to published work: 300-600 words with references where relevant.":"书评须说明作品，评估其证据、贡献、局限与受众，并披露与创作者的关系。评论文章提出聚焦且有依据的论点，并回应反方观点。针对已发表作品的来信：300-600 词，必要时附参考文献。","These labels are content categories beneath The Allyspan Journal, not separate journals. Accepted work is published on a rolling basis following review, production and author approval. Any themed collection or submission deadline will be announced separately.":"这些标签是 The Allyspan Journal 内的内容类别，并非独立期刊。录用作品在审阅、制作与作者批准后陆续发表。专题合集或投稿截止日期将另行公布。","Next: Writing & visuals":"下一节：写作与视觉材料","Academic writing standards":"学术写作标准","Clear arguments, traceable evidence and accessible presentation":"清晰论证、可追溯证据与无障碍呈现","Argument and structure":"论证与结构","State a focused question, its importance and key definitions. Use clear headings, consider counterevidence and limitations, and draw proportionate conclusions. Explain practical implications where useful. Avoid jargon and unsupported certainty.":"提出聚焦的问题，说明重要性与关键定义。使用清晰标题，考虑反向证据和局限，并作出与证据相称的结论。适当时说明实际意义。避免术语堆砌与无依据的确定性。","Sources and citations":"来源与引注","Use APA 7 author-date citations and matching references, with DOI links or stable URLs where available. Verify originals and quotation locators. Cite legal materials using applicable conventions and enough detail to locate the authoritative text.":"使用 APA 第 7 版作者—日期引注及对应参考文献，有条件时附 DOI 或稳定网址。核实原始资料及引文位置。法律材料按适用规范引用，提供足以查找权威文本的信息。","Prefer peer-reviewed research for empirical claims and primary official sources for current law, policies and rules. Use current and foundational evidence as appropriate; identify non-peer-reviewed material. News supplies context, not a substitute for stronger evidence. Sources must be sufficient, relevant and balanced.":"实证主张优先采用同行评审研究；现行法律、政策与规则优先采用官方一手资料。适当结合近期与基础性证据，并标明未经同行评审的材料。新闻可提供背景，不能代替更有力证据。来源须充分、相关且平衡。","Precision and reporting":"准确性与研究报告","Distinguish correlation from causation and statistical from practical significance. Report design, denominators, effect sizes and uncertainty where relevant; explain conflicting findings and limits. Never invent participants, interviews, quotations, results or references. Label hypothetical examples; fictional exercises are not completed research.":"区分相关与因果、统计显著性与实际意义。适用时报告设计、分母、效应量及不确定性，解释矛盾发现与局限。不得虚构参与者、访谈、引语、结果或参考文献。假设例子须标明；虚构练习不等于已完成研究。","Respectful language and accessibility":"尊重的语言与无障碍","Use respectful, accurate language, explain abbreviations and recognize differences within communities. Research, evidence reviews, policy and practice analyses need a 75-125-word plain-language summary; reflective pieces need a 40-75-word introduction.":"使用尊重、准确的语言，解释缩略语，并承认社区内部差异。研究、证据综述、政策与实践分析须有 75-125 词通俗摘要；反思性文章须有 40-75 词引言。","Illustrations and visual materials":"插图与视觉材料","Authors may propose photographs, illustrations, charts, tables and other visuals. Identify sources and ownership or publication permissions; provide captions and descriptive alt text. The Editorial Team may accept, request changes to, replace or decline visuals based on relevance, accuracy, accessibility, privacy, quality and Allyspan’s design standards. Allyspan may propose additional illustrations. Substantive visuals and changes affecting interpretation require author approval before publication.":"作者可提出照片、插图、图表、表格及其他视觉材料。说明来源、所有权或发表授权，提供图注与描述性替代文字。编辑团队可根据相关性、准确性、无障碍、隐私、质量与 Allyspan 设计标准，接受、要求修改、替换或拒绝材料。Allyspan 可建议增添插图。实质性视觉材料及影响解释的修改，发表前须获作者批准。","Decorative illustrations must not imply that they show actual participants, clients or documented events. Disclose AI-generated or substantially altered visuals and label them where needed. Authors verify data, scales, labels and any changes to research figures. Provide editable tables and source notes; do not rely on color alone. The Editorial Team makes publication decisions; the design lead approves visual consistency, composition, colors and design quality without overriding accuracy.":"装饰插图不得暗示其展示真实参与者、服务对象或有记录的事件。须披露人工智能生成或大幅修改的视觉材料，并在必要时标示。作者须核实数据、刻度、标签及研究图形的修改。提供可编辑表格与来源说明，不可仅依靠颜色传达信息。编辑团队负责发表决定；设计负责人审核视觉一致性、构图、色彩与质量，但不得凌驾于准确性之上。","Translations and research reporting":"翻译与研究报告","Translations must identify the original work, translator, permissions and review method; prior agreement and a competent reviewer are required. Submit initially in English. If English isn't your first language, tell us when you submit - we'll discuss translation, and we publish in your language too where we can. Review takes place in English; publication in another language depends on translation and review capacity. Research must follow applicable APA reporting standards and requested discipline-specific guidance; no APA endorsement is implied.":"译文须注明原作、译者、授权及审阅方法，并事先达成协议、安排具备能力的审阅者。请先以英文投稿；如英语不是你的第一语言，请告知我们。我们会讨论翻译，并在能力允许时以你的语言发表。审阅使用英文；其他语言发表取决于翻译与审阅能力。研究须遵循适用的 APA 报告标准及所要求的学科指南；这不意味着获得 APA 认可。","Next: Ethics & responsibility":"下一节：伦理与责任","Ethics and author responsibility":"伦理与作者责任","Protect people and preserve the integrity of the record":"保护人们，维护出版记录的诚信","Originality, authorship and student work":"原创性、作者资格与学生作品","Submit original work and disclose prior public versions, preprints, theses and substantially overlapping publications. No simultaneous journal submission without prior agreement. All listed authors must make a substantive contribution, approve the final version and accept responsibility for their work. Provide contributor roles and acknowledge other assistance with permission. No honorary authorship or purchased papers.":"提交原创作品，披露先前公开版本、预印本、学位论文及内容大量重叠的出版物。未经事先同意，不得一稿多投。所有署名作者须有实质贡献、批准终稿并承担责任。说明贡献角色，经许可致谢其他协助。不得挂名或购买论文。","A class paper may be adapted if the author has the right to publish it and any course, university, placement or sponsor restrictions are satisfied. A grade or instructor approval is not journal acceptance. Remove course cover pages and disclose class-project origins. Do not imply university, employer or practicum-site endorsement from an author’s affiliation.":"课堂论文可在作者有权发表且满足课程、大学、实习机构或资助方限制时改编。成绩或教师批准不等于期刊录用。删除课程封面并披露课堂项目来源。作者所属机构不得被用来暗示大学、雇主或实习机构认可。","Human participants, consent and confidentiality":"人类参与者、知情同意与保密","Before collecting data, authors must obtain any required institutional ethics review, approval or formal exemption determination. At submission, state the reviewing body, determination, reference number when available and consent approach. Where review was not required, explain why and who made that determination. Editorial review cannot retroactively replace required ethics approval. The applicability of research rules depends on the activity, institution and jurisdiction.":"收集数据前，作者须取得所需机构伦理审查、批准或正式豁免决定。投稿时说明审查机构、决定、可用编号及知情同意方式。如不需审查，说明原因与决定者。编辑审阅不能追溯替代必需的伦理批准。研究规则适用性取决于活动、机构与司法管辖区。","Do not submit client records, identifying school or placement information, private messages or recognizable case histories without a lawful basis, required permissions and editorial clearance. Changing a name alone may not prevent identification. Research participation consent is not automatically consent to public publication of an identifiable story or image. No sensitive source documents or signed consent forms should be sent through ordinary submission email; editors will arrange a secure process if necessary.":"没有合法依据、必要授权与编辑许可，不得提交服务对象记录、可识别学校或实习机构的信息、私人消息或可识别个案。仅改名未必能防止识别。参与研究的同意不自动等于公开可识别故事或图片的同意。不得通过普通投稿邮件发送敏感原始文件或签署的同意书；必要时编辑会安排安全流程。","Conflicts and funding":"利益冲突与资助","Disclose financial and nonfinancial interests, funding, employment, advocacy roles, relevant personal relationships and the sponsor’s role. A disclosed interest does not automatically disqualify a submission. Reviewers and editors must disclose conflicts and recuse where impartial review cannot be maintained. Authors may describe positionality when relevant without being required to disclose sensitive personal identities.":"披露经济与非经济利益、资助、工作、倡导角色、相关私人关系及资助方作用。披露利益不自动导致失去投稿资格。审稿人与编辑须披露冲突，无法保持公正时应回避。作者可说明相关立场背景，无须披露敏感个人身份。","Artificial intelligence":"人工智能","Authors remain accountable for all content. AI cannot be an author. Disclose generative AI use for drafting, translation, analysis, coding or image creation, naming the tool/version when known, purpose and human verification. Routine spelling correction need not be disclosed unless it materially rewrites content. Fabricated citations and synthetic data passed off as real are prohibited. Do not upload private participant information or confidential manuscripts to AI tools without authorization and adequate safeguards. Editors and reviewers need explicit author permission before external AI processing that cannot assure confidentiality.":"作者对全部内容负责。人工智能不能列为作者。须披露用于起草、翻译、分析、编程或图像创作的生成式人工智能，说明已知的工具及版本、用途与人工核实。常规拼写纠正无需披露，除非实质性改写内容。禁止虚构引文或将合成数据冒充真实数据。未经授权与充分保障，不得向人工智能工具上传参与者私人信息或保密稿件。编辑与审稿人若使用无法保证保密的外部人工智能处理，须先获作者明确许可。","Criticism must address verifiable conduct, ideas or evidence. Unsupported allegations, plagiarism, discriminatory attacks, dangerous misinformation and promotional material disguised as scholarship are grounds for rejection or further review.":"批评须针对可核实的行为、观点或证据。无依据指控、抄袭、歧视性攻击、危险错误信息，以及伪装成学术的宣传材料，可导致拒稿或进一步审查。","Next: Prepare your submission":"下一节：准备投稿","How to submit":"如何投稿","One complete submission package":"完整投稿材料","Submissions are open":"现已开放投稿","Prepare your complete submission, then choose Submit Your Work below Checklist & resources. Your work is sent privately for editorial review. Nothing is published automatically.":"准备完整材料后，选择“核对清单与资源”下方的“提交作品”。作品将私下发送以供编辑审阅，不会自动发表。","Manuscript file":"稿件文件","Submit an editable DOCX, DOC, Pages, TXT, RTF or ODT file; a PDF may accompany it but does not replace the editable manuscript. Use 12-point readable type, double spacing, one-inch margins, page numbers and consistent headings. Include title, article type, abstract where required, plain-language summary or introduction, 4-6 keywords, main text and references. Place tables after the references and provide figures separately with captions and alt text.":"提交可编辑的 DOCX、DOC、Pages、TXT、RTF 或 ODT；PDF 可作为补充，不能替代。使用易读的 12 磅字体、双倍行距、一英寸页边距、页码与一致的标题。包含题目、文章类型、按要求提供的学术摘要、通俗摘要或引言、4-6 个关键词、正文与参考文献。表格置于参考文献后，图片单独提供，并附图注与替代文字。","Separate title page and cover note":"单独的标题页与投稿说明","Provide each author’s publication name, accurate role or affiliation, a 50-80-word biography, contributor roles and the corresponding author’s private email. ORCID is optional. State the word count and article type. Summarize the contribution and fit with Allyspan, disclose prior dissemination and related work, and list funding, conflicts, AI use and ethics/permission status. Do not provide a home address, student ID or unnecessary personal data.":"提供每位作者的发表姓名、准确身份或机构、50-80 词简介、贡献角色及通讯作者私人邮箱。ORCID 选填。注明词数与文章类型。概述贡献及与 Allyspan 的契合度，披露此前传播与相关作品，并列明资助、冲突、人工智能使用及伦理和授权状态。勿提供家庭住址、学生证件号码或不必要个人数据。","For an external review, editors may request an anonymized manuscript and separate identifying materials. Anonymity cannot always be guaranteed, particularly for first-person narratives or public preprints. Explain requests for a public pseudonym in advance; editors must privately verify the author and agree on accountability and safety arrangements.":"外部审阅时，编辑可能要求匿名稿件及单独的身份材料。匿名不一定能保证，尤其是第一人称叙事或公开预印本。请事先说明公开使用化名的请求；编辑须私下核实作者身份，并商定责任与安全安排。","Submission route and author declarations":"投稿渠道与作者声明","Use the Journal’s private submission form to send your complete submission. Do not send manuscripts to guessed addresses or post them as comments. The receipt message must identify the policy version and confirm that submission is not acceptance.":"使用期刊的私人投稿表单发送完整材料。不要将稿件发送至猜测的地址或贴在评论中。回执须注明政策版本，并确认投稿不等于录用。","The corresponding author must affirm that all authors agree to submission; the work is accurate and original; required disclosures and permissions are complete; no confidential information is included improperly; and the manuscript is not under review elsewhere unless expressly agreed. Submission grants permission for confidential editorial assessment only. Publication requires separate written author acceptance of the final version and publication terms.":"通讯作者须确认所有作者同意投稿、作品准确原创、披露及授权完整、未不当包含保密信息，以及除非明确同意，稿件未在其他期刊审阅中。投稿仅授权保密编辑评估。发表须另行书面接受终稿与发表条款。","Fees, payment and withdrawal":"费用、报酬与撤稿","There is no submission or publication fee and no guaranteed author payment. Any commissioned payment must be agreed in writing in advance and must not purchase acceptance. Disclose any future fees before submission; never introduce a surprise acceptance charge. Authors may withdraw before publication by written request from the corresponding author with coauthor agreement. Resolve author disputes before release.":"不收投稿费或发表费，也不保证支付作者报酬。约稿报酬须事先书面约定，不得购买录用。未来如有费用，须在投稿前披露，不能录用后突然收费。发表前，通讯作者可经共同作者同意书面申请撤回。作者争议须在发布前解决。","Before you send":"发送前","Confirm: scope and article type; word count; verified citations; accurate policy dates; limitations; accessible summary; permissions and ethics statement; author approval; conflict/funding/AI disclosures; and a clean editable manuscript. Do not include raw identifiable data. Authors under 18 require a separate safeguarding and permission process before any submission is accepted.":"确认范围与类型、词数、引文核实、准确的政策日期、局限、易懂摘要、授权与伦理声明、作者批准、利益冲突／资助／人工智能披露及整洁的可编辑稿件。勿附可识别身份的原始数据。接受未满 18 岁作者的任何投稿前，须另行完成保护与许可程序。","Next: Editorial review":"下一节：编辑审阅","Editorial review and decisions":"编辑审阅与决定","A rigorous process with honest review labels":"严谨流程，如实标明审阅状态","Editorial roles":"编辑职责","The Editor-in-Chief is responsible for publication decisions, supported by handling editors and a Community Discussion Editor for moderated responses. Roles may be combined where conflicts are managed. Subject specialists advise on relevant methods or professional issues. Founders, board members, donors and design approvers do not receive automatic publication preference.":"主编负责发表决定，由责任编辑与负责审核回应的社区讨论编辑协助。妥善管理利益冲突的前提下可兼任角色。领域专家提供方法或专业建议。创始人、董事、捐赠者与设计审批者不会自动获得发表优先权。","Editorial review is not automatically peer review":"编辑审阅不自动等于同行评审","Ordinary publications are labeled “Editorial review.” Formal peer review may be offered only when a qualified process is actually available: at least two independent, appropriately qualified reviewers whose identities are confidential to authors, documented reports, conflict checks, author revision and an editorial decision. Describe the review model accurately for each article. Comments and letters do not become peer-reviewed merely because an editor moderates them. Only verified indexing, identifiers and institutional affiliations will be displayed.":"普通作品标注“编辑审阅”。只有实际具备合格流程时才能提供正式同行评审：至少两位独立且合适的审稿人、身份对作者保密、有记录的报告、利益冲突检查、作者修订及编辑决定。每篇文章须准确说明审阅模式。评论与来信不会因为编辑审核而成为同行评审作品。只展示已核实的收录、标识符与机构背景。","Reviewer criteria":"审阅标准","Assess a focused question, relevance, accuracy, quality and balance of evidence, sound methods where applicable, transparent limitations, ethical compliance, accessibility and useful implications. Distinguish remediable writing issues from invalid methods or missing ethics approval. Reviewers should explain specific changes respectfully; they must not demand irrelevant citations or use unpublished work for personal advantage.":"评估问题是否聚焦、相关性、准确性、证据质量与平衡、适用时的方法合理性、透明局限、伦理合规、无障碍及实际意义。区分可修改的写作问题与无效方法或缺失伦理批准。审稿人应尊重地说明具体修改，不得要求无关引用，或利用未发表作品谋取私利。","Independence, revisions and appeals":"独立性、修订与申诉","A submission by an editor, founder, director or close associate goes to a nonconflicted handling editor; if none is available, postpone review. The author must not control their own acceptance. Send reasoned revision requests and require a point-by-point response. Acceptance and turnaround times are not guaranteed; editors communicate significant delays. Authors may submit one reasoned appeal with evidence of error or unfair process. A noninvolved editor reviews it where possible; if independence cannot be arranged, disclose the limitation.":"编辑、创始人、董事或密切关联者的投稿须交由无冲突的责任编辑；无法安排时延期。作者不得控制自己的录用。修改要求须有理由，并要求逐项回应。不保证录用或处理时限；重大延误会告知作者。作者可提交一次有理由的申诉，并提供错误或程序不公的证据。尽可能由未参与的编辑审查；无法保证独立时应披露局限。","Visual presentation is separate from substantive review. Factual changes require editorial and author review. Editorial decisions are documented with access restricted to authorized personnel.":"视觉呈现与实质审阅分开。事实修改须经编辑与作者审阅。编辑决定须留有记录，仅限获授权人员访问。","Next: Rights & corrections":"下一节：权利与更正","Publication, rights and corrections":"发表、权利与更正","Maintain a trustworthy and transparent public record":"维护可信、透明的公共记录","Author rights and publication permission":"作者权利与发表许可","Authors retain copyright and, through a separate publication agreement, grant Allyspan a nonexclusive license to publish, host, distribute, archive and make agreed formatting/accessibility edits to the accepted work, and use attributed excerpts for Journal promotion. Translation, substantial adaptation or unrelated reuse requires separate agreement. Author-owned work must be distinguished from third-party licensed material. A Creative Commons license is applied only with explicit agreement and a rights check.":"作者保留版权，并通过单独发表协议授予 Allyspan 非独占许可，以发表、托管、分发、存档，进行双方同意的格式及无障碍修改，并使用署名节选宣传期刊。翻译、实质改编或无关再利用须另行同意。区分作者所有作品与第三方授权材料。使用知识共享许可须明确同意并核查权利。","What each article displays":"每篇文章应展示什么","Title; article category; author and accurate affiliation or role; biography; publication and revision dates; actual review label; summary; accessible full text and references; funding, conflicts and material AI disclosures; research ethics statement where relevant; copyright/license information; and a correction/contact route. Add a suggested citation using the stable article URL. Retain version records and readable archives. A DOI or permanent preservation service is not guaranteed; any such arrangement will be identified accurately.":"标题、类别、作者及准确身份或机构、简介、发表与修订日期、实际审阅标签、摘要、可访问的全文与参考文献、资助、冲突与重要人工智能披露、适用时的研究伦理声明、版权／许可信息，以及更正或联系渠道。使用稳定网址提供推荐引文。保留版本记录与可读档案。不保证 DOI 或永久保存服务；如有此类安排，将准确说明。","Editorial independence and reader notice":"编辑独立性与读者须知","Views expressed are the authors’ and do not necessarily represent Allyspan or an affiliated institution. Publication is educational and does not establish a professional relationship or provide individual medical, mental health or legal advice. Journal activity must not be presented as authorization for Allyspan to deliver regulated services. Clearly separate research, opinion, sponsored content and organizational announcements. Journal policy prohibits candidate endorsements or opposition in Journal content published on Allyspan’s behalf; nonpartisan policy analysis remains welcome.":"观点属于作者，不一定代表 Allyspan 或所属机构。发表用于教育，不建立专业服务关系，也不提供个人医疗、心理健康或法律建议。期刊活动不得被视为 Allyspan 提供受监管服务的授权。应清晰区分研究、观点、赞助内容与组织公告。代表 Allyspan 发表的期刊内容不得支持或反对政治候选人；欢迎非党派政策分析。","Corrections and integrity concerns":"更正与诚信疑虑","Authors must promptly report material errors. Readers may privately report concerns through the designated editorial contact, identifying the article, issue and evidence. An uninvolved editor evaluates concerns where possible, seeks an author response and documents the decision. Do not promise absolute confidentiality or retaliate against good-faith reports.":"作者须及时报告重要错误。读者可通过指定编辑联系方式私下提出疑虑，注明文章、问题与证据。尽可能由未参与的编辑评估、征询作者回应并记录决定。不得承诺绝对保密，也不得报复善意报告。","Fix harmless typographical errors without changing meaning. Publish a dated correction for substantive changes and link it to the article. Use an expression of concern when a serious issue remains unresolved and readers need notice. Retract unreliable or seriously unethical work with a reasoned, linked notice; preserve the scholarly record where safe and lawful. Remove identifying or unlawful material when necessary, documenting the action without repeating harmful content. Offer an appeal route.":"不改变原意地修正无害排印错误。实质性修改须发表注明日期并链接原文的更正。严重问题未解决且读者需要知悉时，发布关注声明。对不可靠或严重违反伦理的作品，发布说明理由并链接原文的撤稿通知；在安全合法前提下保留学术记录。必要时移除身份信息或违法材料，记录处理但不重复有害内容。提供申诉途径。","The submission page provides the applicable privacy notice, retention information and contact route. Unpublished submissions are accessible only to authorized editorial personnel, reviewers and necessary service providers under appropriate safeguards. Private reviewer correspondence is not published without permission. Deletion requests are considered subject to legitimate recordkeeping requirements; authors should review the notice before submitting.":"投稿页提供适用的隐私说明、保留信息与联系渠道。未发表稿件仅在适当保障下供获授权编辑人员、审稿人与必要服务商访问。未经许可不公开私人审稿往来。删除请求须考虑合法记录保留要求；投稿前请阅读说明。","Next: Community discussion":"下一节：社区讨论","Community Discussion":"社区讨论","Voices, questions and respectful disagreement":"声音、疑问与尊重的分歧","“Share a question, perspective or evidence-informed response. Comments appear only after editorial review.” These standards apply wherever Community Discussion is enabled. A comment form may not be available on every article.":"“分享问题、观点或以证据为依据的回应。评论经编辑审阅后才会显示。”凡启用社区讨论的地方均适用这些标准。并非每篇文章都有评论表单。","Participation standards":"参与标准","Suggested limit: 50-400 words per comment, with up to 3 relevant links. Respond to the article or an idea it raises; distinguish personal experience from general claims. Cite a reliable source for disputed factual assertions when feasible. Readers need not write an academic essay or disclose a personal diagnosis, service history or identity. Respectful disagreement and criticism of Allyspan are welcome.":"建议每条评论 50-400 词，最多附 3 个相关链接。回应文章或其提出的观点，区分个人经历与普遍主张。可行时为有争议的事实提供可靠来源。读者无需撰写学术论文或披露个人诊断、服务经历或身份。欢迎尊重的分歧及对 Allyspan 的批评。","What will not be published":"不予发表的内容","Threats, harassment, hate speech, identifying client or participant information, doxxing, spam, commercial solicitation, impersonation, plagiarism, unsupported accusations about identifiable people, instructions for harm, or dangerous professional advice. Do not include self-harm methods or graphic detail. Do not treat comments as a confidential service request or emergency-support channel.":"威胁、骚扰、仇恨言论、可识别服务对象或参与者的信息、曝光私人资料、垃圾信息、商业招揽、冒充、抄袭、对可识别人士的无依据指控、伤害指导或危险专业建议。不应包含自伤方法或露骨细节。评论不是保密服务申请或紧急支持渠道。","Premoderation by the Editorial Team":"编辑团队事先审核","Every comment stays private until approved by a trained moderator. Apply the same published rules across viewpoints. Decisions: approve, request revision, decline, or escalate to the handling editor. Do not reject a relevant comment merely because it challenges the article or organization. Permit only light spelling/format edits without changing meaning; obtain consent for substantive edits. Disclose an author/editor’s relevant connection when responding.":"每条评论在受训审核者批准前保持私密。对不同观点适用相同公开规则。处理方式包括批准、要求修改、拒绝或转交责任编辑。不得仅因相关评论挑战文章或组织而拒绝。仅可作不改变含义的轻微拼写／格式编辑；实质修改须获同意。作者或编辑回应时应披露相关关系。","Moderators may close a thread, pause publication or remove a comment for a documented policy violation or safety concern. Give a brief reason where practicable and offer one request for reconsideration by another editor when available. No guaranteed response time. Remove spam or clear privacy risks promptly; do not publicly repeat the harmful details.":"审核者可因有记录的违规或安全问题关闭讨论、暂停发布或移除评论。可行时简要说明原因，如能安排其他编辑，可提供一次复议请求。不保证回复时间。及时移除垃圾信息或明显隐私风险，勿公开重复有害细节。","Privacy and publication consent":"隐私与发表同意","Collect a display name and private email for verification; publish only the agreed display name. Allow a pseudonym under consistent moderation rules. Never display an email or IP address. Minimize logs and follow the published retention notice. Before submission, obtain agreement to the comment rules and permission to display the approved comment under the chosen name. Explain that public comments may be copied by others; do not promise complete removal from the internet.":"收集显示名称与私人邮箱用于核实，仅公开约定的显示名称。按一致审核规则允许化名。不得显示邮箱或 IP 地址。尽量减少日志并遵循公开保留说明。提交前须取得对评论规则的同意，以及以所选名称显示获批评论的许可。说明公开评论可能被他人复制，不承诺从互联网彻底清除。","Comments are not evidence certification":"评论不等于证据认证","Approval means the comment passed moderation, not that Allyspan endorses or independently verifies every statement. Editors may request sources or a formal letter to the editor for substantial critiques. Add a visible notice that the discussion is not continuously monitored and is not a route for urgent or individualized assistance.":"批准仅表示通过审核，并不代表 Allyspan 支持或独立核实每项陈述。重大批评可能被要求提供来源或正式致编辑来信。应明确说明讨论区并非持续监控，也不提供紧急或个别化援助。","Next: Checklist & resources":"下一节：核对清单与资源","Contributor checklist and resources":"投稿核对清单与资源","A final check before submission":"投稿前的最后检查","Manuscript checklist":"稿件清单","Check the article category and word limit. Include a clear argument, required abstract and summary, 4-6 keywords, headings and APA 7 references. Verify citations, quotations, statistics and policy dates. Explain limitations; distinguish evidence, interpretation and experience.":"核对文章类别与词数。包含清晰论证、所需摘要、4-6 个关键词、标题及 APA 第 7 版参考文献。核实引文、引语、统计数据与政策日期。说明局限，区分证据、解释与经历。","Author and ethics checklist":"作者与伦理清单","Confirm all authors’ contributions and approval; accurate roles and affiliations; corresponding-author contact; disclosure of funding, conflicts, prior versions and material AI use; research ethics documentation where applicable; consent and permissions for identifiable stories or third-party material; and no confidential client, student or participant records in the submission.":"确认所有作者贡献与批准、准确身份与机构、通讯作者联系方式、资助／冲突／先前版本／重要人工智能使用披露、适用研究伦理文件、可识别故事或第三方材料的同意与授权，并确保不含服务对象、学生或参与者的保密记录。","Files and permissions":"文件与授权","Provide an editable manuscript, separate title page and cover note, editable tables, figure files with source/permission information and alt text. Do not send signed consent forms or sensitive raw data through ordinary email. A separate publication agreement and approval of the final proof are required before publication. No submission or publication fee is charged.":"提供可编辑稿件、单独标题页与投稿说明、可编辑表格，以及带来源／授权信息与替代文字的图件。不得通过普通邮件发送签署的同意书或敏感原始数据。发表前须另行签署协议并批准最终校样。不收投稿费或发表费。","Contact and decision routes":"联系与决定渠道","Use the official submission form or editorial email displayed on the Journal website when submissions are open. For an appeal, correction, privacy concern or integrity report, use the designated editorial contact and identify the article or submission. Include a concise explanation and supporting evidence without unnecessary personal information. Do not post confidential complaints in public comments.":"开放投稿时使用期刊网站公布的官方表单或编辑邮箱。申诉、更正、隐私或诚信报告须联系指定编辑渠道，并注明文章或投稿。简要说明情况、提供证据，避免不必要个人信息。勿在公开评论中发布保密投诉。","Reference framework":"参考框架","These are Allyspan’s own editorial policies, informed by the resources below. They do not imply membership, accreditation, endorsement or certification by these organizations.":"这些是 Allyspan 自身的编辑政策，参考下列资源制定。不表示获得这些组织的会员资格、认证、认可或证明。","APA Style. Style and grammar guidelines; Journal Article Reporting Standards.":"APA Style。写作与语法指南；期刊文章报告标准。","https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines":"https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines","https://apastyle.apa.org/jars":"https://apastyle.apa.org/jars","COPE, DOAJ, OASPA and WAME. Principles of Transparency and Best Practice in Scholarly Publishing.":"COPE、DOAJ、OASPA 与 WAME。学术出版透明度与最佳实践原则。","https://doi.org/10.24318/cope.2019.1.12":"https://doi.org/10.24318/cope.2019.1.12","ICMJE. Use of Artificial Intelligence in Publishing.":"ICMJE。出版中的人工智能使用。","https://www.icmje.org/recommendations/browse/artificial-intelligence/":"https://www.icmje.org/recommendations/browse/artificial-intelligence/","U.S. HHS, Office for Human Research Protections. Human Subject Regulations Decision Charts: 2018 Requirements.":"美国卫生与公众服务部人类研究保护办公室。人类受试者法规决策图：2018 年要求。","https://www.hhs.gov/ohrp/regulations-and-policy/decision-charts-2018/index.html":"https://www.hhs.gov/ohrp/regulations-and-policy/decision-charts-2018/index.html","Version and future changes":"版本与未来变更","Version 1.1 | October 17, 2026. This edition adds the illustration policy to the baseline public contributor manual. Future substantive revisions will carry a new version and date. New requirements apply prospectively unless ethics, law or safety require immediate action; affected contributors will be informed. Visual branding changes do not alter editorial requirements.":"版本 1.1 | 2026年10月17日。本版在基础公开投稿手册中加入插图政策。未来实质修订将注明新版本与日期。除伦理、法律或安全要求立即采取行动外，新要求面向后续投稿实施，并告知受影响投稿者。视觉品牌变化不改变编辑要求。","Return to submission guidance":"返回投稿说明","Change language":"更改语言","Language":"语言","Cancel":"取消","Confirm":"确认","Close":"关闭","Languages":"语言","Search Allyspan":"搜索 Allyspan","Search the Allyspan website":"搜索 Allyspan 网站","Main navigation":"主导航","Allyspan home":"Allyspan 首页","No matching pages found":"未找到匹配页面","This article is currently available in English. Translations will be added after review.":"本文目前仅提供英文版。译文将在审阅后添加。","English article":"英文文章","English is the original version. If wording differs, please consult the English text.":"英文为原文。如措辞有差异，请参阅英文版。","Changing language will clear the unfinished form. Continue?":"更改语言将清除尚未提交的表单。是否继续？","Paste a link first.":"请先粘贴链接。","That link doesn’t look complete. Check it and try again.":"链接似乎不完整。请检查后重试。","Please use a website link that starts with http:// or https://.":"请使用以 http:// 或 https:// 开头的网站链接。","Please enter a complete website address, like example.com.":"请输入完整网址，例如 example.com。","The QR generator didn’t load. Check your internet connection and try again.":"二维码生成器未加载。请检查网络后重试。","Could not create the QR code. Try a shorter link.":"无法创建二维码。请尝试更短的链接。","Please use {min}-{max} words.":"请使用 {min}-{max} 个英文单词。","{n} words":"{n} 个单词","{min}-{max} words, following the contributor guide.":"按投稿指南要求，使用 {min}-{max} 个英文单词。","Enter 4-6 different keywords, separated by commas.":"请输入 4-6 个不同关键词，以英文逗号分隔。","Choose a supported file format.":"请选择支持的文件格式。"," (optional)":"（选填）","Caption":"图注","Alt text":"替代文字","Source and permission details":"来源与授权详情","Coauthor":"共同作者","Publication name":"发表姓名","Role or affiliation":"身份或所属机构","Short biography (50-80 words)":"简短个人简介（50-80 个英文单词）","Please use 50-80 words.":"请使用 50-80 个英文单词。","Contribution":"贡献","Remove coauthor":"移除共同作者","Please check the highlighted field before continuing.":"请检查标示的字段后再继续。","Article type":"文章类型","Main topic":"主要议题","Word count":"词数","Summary":"摘要","Manuscript":"稿件","None":"无","Companion PDF":"补充 PDF","Supporting images":"辅助图片","Translation notes":"翻译说明","Private email":"私人邮箱","Biography":"个人简介","Safety request":"安全请求","Declarations":"声明","All four declarations confirmed.":"四项声明均已确认。","Attachments must total no more than 10 MB.":"附件总大小不得超过 10 MB。","Submissions are temporarily unavailable. Please try again later.":"投稿服务暂不可用，请稍后重试。","Send your manuscript privately for editorial review. Nothing is published automatically.":"私下发送稿件以供编辑审阅。不会自动发表任何内容。","Your manuscript will be sent privately to the Journal. We will email a receipt after delivery.":"稿件将私下发送给期刊。投递后我们会发送邮件回执。","Questions or withdrawal requests: journal@allyspan.org":"咨询或撤稿请求：journal@allyspan.org","Required fields are marked *. Do not include confidential participant records.":"必填项以 * 标示。请勿提供参与者保密记录。","Review your details before sending. Nothing is published automatically.":"发送前请检查信息。不会自动发表任何内容。","The security check could not load. Please try again later.":"无法加载安全验证，请稍后重试。","The submission service could not be reached. Please try again later.":"无法连接投稿服务，请稍后重试。","Sending...":"正在发送……","We could not confirm delivery. Keep this page open and try again.":"无法确认投递。请保持页面打开后重试。","We could not confirm delivery. Please try again.":"无法确认投递，请重试。","Thank you for your submission":"感谢投稿","Your work has been received for editorial review. Nothing has been published.":"已收到你的作品，将供编辑审阅。尚未发表任何内容。","Your reference: ":"你的投稿编号：","A receipt email has been requested. If it does not arrive, check spam or contact journal@allyspan.org with your reference.":"已请求发送回执邮件。如未收到，请查看垃圾邮件，或联系 journal@allyspan.org 并注明投稿编号。","We aim to give an initial response within 15 business days of a complete submission.":"收到完整投稿后，我们争取在 15 个工作日内作出初步回复。","We could not confirm delivery. Keep the form open and try again.":"无法确认投递。请保持表单打开后重试。","required":"必填","Submission steps":"投稿步骤","Submission service status":"投稿服务状态","Your generated QR code":"已生成的二维码","Allyspan golden tree and sun emblem":"Allyspan 金色树与太阳徽标","New York City skyline at dusk":"暮色中的纽约市天际线","Please wait a minute before trying again.":"请等待一分钟后重试。","Please complete the security check again.":"请重新完成安全验证。","Submissions are not open yet.":"投稿尚未开放。","Unable to verify this request.":"无法验证此请求。","Please reopen the form and try again.":"请重新打开表单后重试。","The submission is empty.":"投稿内容为空。","Repeated fields are not supported.":"不支持重复字段。","Check the article type and manuscript word count.":"请检查文章类型与稿件词数。","Include 4-6 different keywords.":"请提供 4-6 个不同关键词。","Enter one valid corresponding author email.":"请输入一个有效的通讯作者邮箱。","Choose the manuscript language.":"请选择稿件语言。","Complete the research ethics question.":"请回答研究伦理问题。","Confirm all four author declarations.":"请确认全部四项作者声明。","For more than 20 coauthors, contact journal@allyspan.org.":"共同作者超过 20 人时，请联系 journal@allyspan.org。","Attach one editable manuscript.":"请附上一份可编辑稿件。","Unsupported or empty attachment.":"附件为空或格式不受支持。","Use no more than 20 supporting images.":"辅助图片不得超过 20 张。","An attachment does not match its file format.":"某附件与其文件格式不符。","TXT manuscripts must be UTF-8 text.":"TXT 稿件须使用 UTF-8 文本编码。","Your work was received, but we could not confirm your receipt email. Keep this reference and contact journal@allyspan.org if needed.":"作品已收到，但无法确认回执邮件。请保留编号，必要时联系 journal@allyspan.org。","We could not confirm delivery. Keep the form open and try again. If you have received a reference by email, contact journal@allyspan.org before resubmitting.":"无法确认投递。请保持表单打开后重试。如已通过邮件收到编号，请在再次投稿前联系 journal@allyspan.org。","The summary must contain 100-150 words.":"摘要须包含 100-150 个英文单词。","The biography must contain 50-80 words.":"个人简介须包含 50-80 个英文单词。","Each coauthor biography must contain 50-80 words.":"每位共同作者的简介须包含 50-80 个英文单词。","Review and receipt emails currently use English.":"审阅与回执邮件目前使用英文。","Allyspan — Support That Stays Beside You":"Allyspan - 始终相伴的支持","Allyspan. Support That Stays Beside You.":"Allyspan。始终相伴的支持。","More ways to connect":"更多联结方式","Contributor links":"投稿者链接","New York City skyline across the water at dusk":"隔水望去的暮色纽约市天际线","Contributor guide sections":"投稿指南章节","Journal links":"期刊链接","Allyspan emblem: a golden sun above a branching tree with an intertwined trunk and stepped foundation":"Allyspan 徽标：交织树干、繁茂枝叶与阶梯形基座上方的一轮金色太阳","Allyspan gold tree emblem":"Allyspan 金色树徽标","Generated QR code with Allyspan website and tagline beneath":"生成的二维码，下方附有 Allyspan 网址与标语","QR code generator":"二维码生成器","This field is required.":"此项为必填。","Please enter a valid email address.":"请输入有效的电子邮箱。","Please check this field.":"请检查此项内容。"},"articleNotes":{"es":"Este artículo está disponible por ahora en inglés. Añadiremos traducciones después de su revisión.","zh-Hans":"本文目前仅提供英文版。译文将在审阅后添加。"},"search":[{"title":"Allyspan","text":"Allyspan","url":"/zh-hans/"},{"title":"Allyspan 与标志","text":"Allyspan 与标志","url":"/zh-hans/about/allyspan-and-logo/"},{"title":"我们的使命","text":"我们的使命","url":"/zh-hans/about/our-mission/"},{"title":"Programs and Partnerships","text":"Programs and Partnerships","url":"/zh-hans/about/our-support/"},{"title":"联系我们","text":"联系我们","url":"/zh-hans/about/connect/"},{"title":"Classroom Studio Guide for Teachers and Learners","text":"Classroom Studio Guide for Teachers and Learners","url":"/zh-hans/resources/introduction-to-classroom-studio/"},{"title":"Free QR Code Generator","text":"Free QR Code Generator","url":"/zh-hans/resources/qr-studio/"},{"title":"The Allyspan Journal","text":"The Allyspan Journal","url":"/zh-hans/showcase/publications/"},{"title":"如何发表作品","text":"如何发表作品","url":"/zh-hans/showcase/how-to-publish/"},{"title":"提交作品","text":"提交作品","url":"/zh-hans/showcase/submit-your-work/"},{"title":"Submission Privacy","text":"Submission Privacy","url":"/zh-hans/showcase/submission-privacy/"}]};
